          <p>
            Fifty-gallon tanks come in three shapes: tall, medium or short, and the extra-tall hybrid. They hold the same water but differ by more than 2 feet in height, so the shape decides where the tank can go. Measure the space, the door you will carry it through and the height of any ductwork or shelving above it before you choose a model.
          </p>

          <div class="overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl my-8">
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
              <table class="w-full text-left">
                <thead class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
